WEBVTT

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:33.060
We'll be right back.

00:01:00.410 --> 00:01:00.590
You

00:01:56.780 --> 00:01:59.650
Year 10, December

00:02:30.440 --> 00:02:41.740
Due to conduct unbecoming the lord of a large domain, Tadanaga Tokugawa was ordered to commit seppuku, despite his standing as Shogun Iemitsu's younger brother.

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:52.370
Tales of his misconduct have been passed down through the generations, although none have ever been confirmed as true.

00:03:04.030 --> 00:03:07.340
Kanye, Year 10, Soon-Poo Castle.

00:03:11.230 --> 00:03:15.900
My lord, there was something I would like to say to you, if I may.

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:21.860
Something stinks.

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:33.790
My request is something I wish you to accept at any cost.

00:03:36.040 --> 00:03:42.960
It concerns the match to be held September 24th inside the castle walls.

00:03:43.450 --> 00:03:47.390
Please do not force the swordsmen to use real blades.

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:50.010
I beg of you to stop.

00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:56.800
Their swordsmanship can be represented fairly using Bokan.

00:03:58.980 --> 00:03:59.960
Use real blades.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:03.340
The real katana would be a waste of these highly skilled men.

00:04:14.090 --> 00:04:17.930
It's a beast now.

00:04:18.790 --> 00:04:21.890
Some bull castle is bound toward Toshio Dago Gonzama.

00:04:22.150 --> 00:04:28.090
To violate the castle's garden with blood at a time like this would be seen as defiance toward the government.

00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:29.980
It would bring-

00:04:30.060 --> 00:04:36.140
nothing but despair to his lordship's family therefore on behalf of those swordsmen i will

00:04:36.140 --> 00:04:57.250
show you the result of using real blades this is what a real sword would do to those men this is it

00:04:57.620 --> 00:04:58.360
my lord

00:05:00.920 --> 00:05:03.720
Tsuriko is worth 550,000, Goku.

00:05:04.180 --> 00:05:09.750
Are you saying, my lord, that you would desire this match even if it were to cost you that domain?

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:47.570
September 24th, the same year.

00:06:07.040 --> 00:06:14.770
Indeed, it is a pointless thing to lose such skilled samurai in a match using real swords.

00:06:20.300 --> 00:06:29.960
However, we can stop our lord and stop him when even Toridonos...

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:33.380
sacrificed his life and was still ignored.

00:06:37.680 --> 00:06:42.540
We all know quite well that a samurai's life is not his own.

00:06:53.550 --> 00:06:59.070
The biggest honor a samurai can achieve is to die in the name of his lord.

00:07:41.580 --> 00:07:43.600
Miei Dono, what is the matter?

00:07:47.600 --> 00:07:52.980
Saw you, had a vision of you, and you were winning the match.

00:07:59.240 --> 00:07:59.980
Genosuke Fujii-

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:02.800
Jiki, it is time for your match.

00:08:26.660 --> 00:08:28.060
The pleasure of our lord.

00:08:28.240 --> 00:08:29.420
The match will now commence.

00:08:34.670 --> 00:08:41.250
Yes, sir. On the west. Genosuke Fujiki.

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:58.600
One arm? If I remember correctly, this is the man recommended by you, Saigusa.

00:08:59.480 --> 00:08:59.940
You are.

00:09:00.030 --> 00:09:00.250
Correct.

00:09:01.040 --> 00:09:02.120
Have you lost your mind?

00:09:02.340 --> 00:09:05.560
The only thing a one-armed swordsman can do out there is...

00:09:05.590 --> 00:09:06.570
Is win.

00:09:09.620 --> 00:09:10.260
You, Godano.

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:18.950
Ah, you use the Kogan style, which is said to be unrivaled in the Nobi area.

00:09:19.800 --> 00:09:25.700
Genosuke Fujiki, you come recommended by Chief Retainer Saigusa-sama, the Lord of Izu, correct?

00:09:28.260 --> 00:09:29.980
To be safe, I must...

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:31.680
give your body an inspection.

00:09:32.640 --> 00:09:34.480
Please, take your time.

00:09:39.700 --> 00:09:48.090
A wound of defeat. Is it acceptable

00:09:48.090 --> 00:09:50.070
to bring such a man before our Lord?

00:10:00.570 --> 00:10:08.400
It was clear to me that he had been diligent in developing the muscles on his back to compensate for his missing arm.

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:19.560
On the east, Sagan Iroko.

00:10:31.020 --> 00:10:34.500
Ikku, I will be fine.

00:10:53.160 --> 00:10:53.580
Cripple?

00:10:55.220 --> 00:10:56.500
And that is not all.

00:10:59.000 --> 00:10:59.700
He's black.

00:11:07.550 --> 00:11:16.720
Genosuke Fujiki, Sigen Iroko, without hesitation, please exhibit to the greatest extent of your abilities your sword skills for our lord.

00:11:45.610 --> 00:11:47.830
One-armed man versus a blind cripple.

00:11:48.280 --> 00:11:50.060
To stain the garden with such a show,

00:11:50.360 --> 00:11:52.820
it is unworthy of being called martial arts.

00:11:53.200 --> 00:11:54.960
There is no excuse for it.

00:11:55.280 --> 00:11:58.120
Enough. Look at them, Asakura.

00:12:00.510 --> 00:12:09.770
To swordsmen of such indomitable spirit, they will take this cruel fate given them and use it to stir their souls until finally.

00:12:30.190 --> 00:12:31.970
I have not seen it before.

00:12:35.030 --> 00:12:38.280
Did Irako-sama certain victory stance?

00:12:40.260 --> 00:12:41.740
Mumyo Saka Nagare.

00:12:46.670 --> 00:12:50.220
Fujiki-sama, I want you to slay him.

00:12:52.130 --> 00:12:53.470
Please kill Irako.

00:12:53.630 --> 00:12:58.440
I detest him so, so very much.

00:14:13.660 --> 00:14:16.680
I cannot breathe to their swordsmanship.

00:14:19.820 --> 00:14:22.180
Their swordplay is abnormal.

00:14:46.990 --> 00:14:50.570
Ginna, Year 8, Tootomi Province.

00:15:14.330 --> 00:15:17.310
Here it is, Suba Zemari.

00:15:18.740 --> 00:15:22.500
A tough move. He is not even able to say I give up.

00:15:31.650 --> 00:15:41.020
That will be enough.

00:15:44.680 --> 00:15:51.410
Fujiki, could you not have tried and...

00:15:51.690 --> 00:15:53.110
How do I put this?

00:15:53.970 --> 00:15:55.550
Gone easier on him?

00:15:56.340 --> 00:15:57.340
Mushimata, Shihan.

00:15:58.010 --> 00:15:59.970
They will never learn unless it hurts.

00:16:04.420 --> 00:16:04.860
Reporting!

00:16:06.410 --> 00:16:08.510
A man with another style is at the entrance.

00:16:26.290 --> 00:16:27.810
My name is Sagan Irako.

00:16:28.700 --> 00:16:29.940
I am here to challenge your-

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:42.820
Master Iwamoto sensei father father a man with another style has come to the dojo

00:17:15.480 --> 00:17:28.360
Challenging our dojo?

00:17:33.900 --> 00:17:36.720
Very well. I will let our sensei know.

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:42.500
However, the rules of this dojo state that you must first face two of our apprentices

00:17:42.500 --> 00:17:45.260
before you can challenge sensei.

00:17:48.100 --> 00:17:49.100
That will be fine.

00:18:03.800 --> 00:18:08.300
Matching our apprentices against swordsmen of other styles is a vital part of training,

00:18:08.920 --> 00:18:11.660
as vital as the rules governing the match itself.

00:18:12.350 --> 00:18:15.950
Yet regardless of whom is victorious at the end of the match,

00:18:17.760 --> 00:18:20.500
no grudge of any kind should ever be borne.

00:18:24.880 --> 00:18:27.770
Treat with courtesy, swordsmen of other styles.

00:18:31.310 --> 00:18:34.240
Killing them, of course, is never allowed.

00:18:35.550 --> 00:18:39.080
We give them a new look and send them back.

00:18:41.490 --> 00:18:47.700
Make the bodies of those who challenge us a living message that shows the strength of the Kogan style.

00:18:48.270 --> 00:18:51.410
This will raise the reputation and fame of the dojo.

00:19:02.040 --> 00:19:03.980
They are unnecessary for swordplay.

00:19:06.930 --> 00:19:10.310
It seems the tip of Fujiki's sword is fired up.

00:19:15.730 --> 00:19:18.030
Young upstart jumps right in.

00:19:21.010 --> 00:19:21.650
Tsubazamari.

00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:23.620
I will...

00:19:31.050 --> 00:19:32.250
He missed his chance.

00:19:38.500 --> 00:19:39.140
What is happening?

00:19:40.050 --> 00:19:42.840
Hmm, something is wrong with Fujiki.

00:19:53.600 --> 00:19:54.160
Interesting.

00:19:55.500 --> 00:19:55.960
Good army.

00:20:03.670 --> 00:20:04.490
Enough.

00:20:09.060 --> 00:20:09.760
Assistant Instructor!

00:20:09.920 --> 00:20:10.300
Shihandai!

00:20:10.380 --> 00:20:11.380
Fujiki Shihandai!

00:20:11.460 --> 00:20:17.860
There's nothing.

00:20:18.780 --> 00:20:19.720
This is not over.

00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:25.750
This, this is not over yet.

00:20:25.990 --> 00:20:27.600
Do you hear me?

00:20:28.580 --> 00:20:29.880
I am certain you think-

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:56.280
that i said enough not not over yet fujiki do you hear yes fujiki i know

00:21:26.560 --> 00:21:27.960
be the next person you face.

00:21:48.880 --> 00:21:51.340
it is to be another sparring match using Bokin.

00:22:00.700 --> 00:22:03.120
Now please, forgive my rudeness.

00:23:30.640 --> 00:23:30.980
Mm-hmm.
